{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_8","type":"command_execution","command":"/usr/bin/bash -lc \"rg -n 'snapshot|budget|git-tree' .pose/knowledge; head -16 /var/tmp/closeout/ac-bg.out; head -12 /var/tmp/closeout/sc-bg.out; head -60 .pose/results/delivery-validation.json; cat .pose/rules/backend-go.md\"","aggregated_output":".pose/knowledge/2026-10-27-handoff-delegation-mcp-round5.md:29:The attempt handle remains usable, continuation retains its attempt and ledger, and cancellation does not bypass budgets or create an approval. D4 defers starting tasks over MCP, while resume/handoff of existing tasks are delivered. D3 resolves an authorized unambiguous project using the common project-scope contract.\n.pose/knowledge/2026-10-20-handoff-pose-b07-implementation.md:10:  spec: \"spec:pose-git-and-dispatch-snapshot-integrity\"\n.pose/knowledge/2026-10-20-handoff-pose-b07-implementation.md:20:B07 retomada e reconciliada com a história completa do PR #195. Implementação explicitamente autorizada pelo mantenedor; branch canônica de trabalho `impl/pose-b07-git-snapshot-integrity`.\n.pose/knowledge/2026-10-20-handoff-pose-b07-implementation.md:33:1. Canonical worktree: /tmp/pose-b07-closeout-work, branch impl/pose-b07-git-snapshot-integrity. Merge a4c58e9 preserves the full PR195 history through 23643a2 and the original native start. Do not overwrite concurrent documentation changes in the shared checkout.\n.pose/knowledge/2026-10-20-handoff-pose-b07-implementation.md:52:- [Spec](../specs/2026-10-13-pose-git-and-dispatch-snapshot-integrity.md).\n.pose/knowledge/2026-11-04-handoff-pose-b34-implementation.md:35:Consultar `report:2026-11-06-pose-b34-global-review-view-budget.md`. Ainda não há\nartifact.spec=pose-git-snapshot-budget-scales-with-the-tree\nartifact.change_set=cs-3764e4bde0e1\nartifact.change_set.base=ca66b779b3c83932c3273427ad1cd8c3c7a40a98\nartifact.change_set.head=8432edbf039ff268cb56907f8272c479c503d51a\nartifact.change_set.commits=30\nartifact.diff_diges